<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoTokenGetCharacter</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to retrieve the character value of a
    token</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">char SilikoTokenGetCharacter(const SilikoToken *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoTokenGetCharacter</function> function gets the
character value of <varname>object</varname>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoTokenGetCharacter</function> returns the character
  value of <varname>object</varname> if <varname>object</varname>
  holds a character value. If <varname>object</varname> does not
  hold a character token, then
  <function>SilikoTokenGetCharacter</function> returns the delete
  character (0x7f).</para>
</refsection>
